<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<data>
	<father type="energy">
		<![CDATA[]]>
		<bullet color="yagold" composeLv="99" dropLevelArr="999">
			<name>consScorpio</name><dpsMul>8</dpsMul><uiDpsMul>10.5</uiDpsMul><extraMul>8.5</extraMul>
			<cnName>天蝎座</cnName><iconUrl>newGun/consScorpioIcon</iconUrl>
			<attackType>holy</attackType><noMagneticB>1</noMagneticB>
			<aiShootRange>1600</aiShootRange><!-- ai射程 -->
			<!--基本-->
			<capacity>50</capacity>
			<attackGap>0.7</attackGap>
			<reloadGap>1.4</reloadGap>
			<bulletWidth>40</bulletWidth>
			<!--武器属性------------------------------------------------------------ -->
			<armsArmMul>0.55</armsArmMul>
			<upValue>2</upValue>
			<shootAngle>3</shootAngle>
			<shakeAngle>3</shakeAngle>
			<shootShakeAngle>15</shootShakeAngle>
			<shootRecoil>7</shootRecoil>
			<screenShakeValue>8</screenShakeValue>
			<!--基本属性------------------------------------------------------------ -->
			<noShakeTime>0.5</noShakeTime>
			<bulletLife>4</bulletLife>
			<hitType>rect</hitType>
			<!--运动属性------------------------------------------------------------ -->	
			<bulletSpeed>40</bulletSpeed>
			<speedD a="-40" min="20"/>
			<!--特殊------------------------------------------------------------ -->
			<penetrationGap>1000</penetrationGap>
			<skillArr>Hit_AddLifeMul_ArmsSkill,Hit_Spurting_ArmsSkill</skillArr>
			<godSkillArr>consScorpioSkill</godSkillArr>
			<followD value="1.8" noLM="1" />
			<!--图像动画属性------------------------------------------------------------ -->
			<flipX>1</flipX>
			<bulletImgUrl name="consScorpioBullet"/>
			<smokeImgUrl name="smallMissleSmokeSm"></smokeImgUrl>
			
			<hitImgUrl name="consScorpioHit"></hitImgUrl>
			<fireImgUrl name="purpleGunFire"></fireImgUrl>
			<shootSoundUrl>newGun/consScorpioSound</shootSoundUrl>
			<!--图像范围------------------------------------------------------------ -->
			<bodyImgRange>newGun/consScorpio</bodyImgRange>
			<bulletImgRange>specialGun/bullet</bulletImgRange>
			<info>源自星穹的自主攻击型武器，一旦周遭战火燃起，它便会迅速锁定目标，疯狂倾泻弹雨。</info>
			<description></description>
		</bullet>
	</father>
	<father name="godArmsSkill" cnName="神级武器技能">
		<skill>
			<name>consScorpioSkill</name><inBodyType>wear</inBodyType><!-- 装上该武器时，技能成为人物技能，而不由武器触发 -->
			<cnName>自主攻击</cnName><noRandomListB>1</noRandomListB><ignoreImmunityB>1</ignoreImmunityB><noSkillDodgeB>1</noSkillDodgeB>
			<!--触发条件与目标------------------------------------------------------------ -->
			<conditionType>passive</conditionType>
			<condition>otherHit</condition>
			<otherConditionArr>puArmsSkillHaveNow</otherConditionArr>
			<target noExistB="1">me</target>
			<!--效果------------------------------------------------------------ -->
			<addType>instant</addType>
			<effectType>consScorpioSkill</effectType>
			<mul>2</mul>
			<minTriggerT>0.29</minTriggerT>
			<description>你的副手、载具、尸宠攻击敌人时，会同时激发你手上的天蝎座，使其发射子弹（跟踪型，可穿竖盾）。最短触发间隔[minTriggerT]秒（射速Buff越高，间隔越短）。天蝎座建议装配“穿人器”零件，可使武器输出提高50%~75%。</description>
		</skill>
	</father>
</data>